OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFirst day of Ukraine peace talks 'very
OL,4,Aproductive', US says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough expectations for a
OL,7,Fbreakthrough that ends Russia's
OL,8,Ffull-scale war on Ukraine are low, US
OL,9,Fofficials said earlier that Moscow and
OL,10,FKyiv were privately showing "a little
OL,11,Fbit of flexibility" on the issue of who
OL,12,Fwould control Ukraine's eastern regions
OL,13,Fin a postwar scenario.
OL,15,FAt the start of Tuesday's talks
OL,16,FPresident Donald Trump's son-in-law,
OL,17,FJared Kushner, told delegates that the
OL,18,FUS had "narrowed the gaps" between the
OL,19,Ftwo sides, without providing details,
OL,20,Fand hoped to move towards a "solution
OL,21,Fthat hopefully ends the war".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
